<title>USA: Maxim Group sets 1 mln share buyback.</title>
<headline>Maxim Group sets 1 mln share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>KENNESAW, Ga. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maxim Group Inc said Monday its directors had approved a program to repurchase up to one million shares of common stock in the open market.</p>
<p>&quot;At its present trading levels, there is a compelling reason for a repurchase program for our common shares. The stock repurchase program serves both our current stockholders and our company well,&quot; said Maxim Chairman and Chief Executive A.J. Nassar.</p>
<p>Maxim is a floor covering retailer operating in about 600 locations in the U.S. and Canada, including 57 company-owned stores.</p>
</text>
